# Cloudflare Pages — redirects + rewrites
# Agoura Hills Dental Designs · SEO Technical Week 1
#
# Format: SOURCE  DESTINATION  STATUS
#   200 = rewrite (URL stays, content from destination)
#   301 = permanent redirect (URL changes, search engines update)
#
# CANONICAL: https://agourahillsdentaldesigns.com/<slug>  (non-www, flat)
#
# www → apex is enforced at the Cloudflare DNS / Pages "Custom Domains" UI
# (set apex as primary). The rule below is a defence-in-depth fallback that
# only runs if the platform layer ever misroutes.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ───────── www → apex fallback (defence-in-depth) ─────────
https://www.agourahillsdentaldesigns.com/*  https://agourahillsdentaldesigns.com/:splat  301!

