# SEO Technical Week 2 — canonical consolidation + legacy slug cleanup
# Added 2026-06-08 in response to Google Search Console audit:
#   - 8 "Crawled, currently not indexed" pages (trailing-slash duplicates
#     + dead Wix legacy URLs were splitting ranking signal)
#   - 4 "Not found (404)" pages from external backlinks pointing to old
#     Wix slugs that were never redirected after migration
# Fixing these consolidates link equity onto the apex non-trailing
# canonical and eliminates the duplicate-content signal that was
# dropping us to page 3-4 on competitive terms.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

